<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Otis cautions it still in talks.</title>
<headline>Otis cautions it still in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Otis Elevatior Company Ltd said on Monday that it was still in talks could have an impact on its share price.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to continue exercising caution in their share dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
